<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-World Series tournament standings.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-World Series tournament standings.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings in the World Series triangular limited overs cricket competition on Tuesday (tabulate under played, won, lost, points).</p>
<p>    West Indies   5    3     2	 6</p>
<p>    Pakistan	5    3     2	 6</p>
<p>    Australia     6    2     4	 4</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
